{"output":"I’ll inspect authorization and cache handling, fix the isolation gaps, then run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject detail lacks a membership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate lists. I’ll check the stored owner before reads or updates and use a delimiter-safe organization prefix to invalidate only that organization’s list variants.\n\nFixed owner-membership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all variants only for the updated project’s organization. Authorization remains checked before cache access.\n\nAdded regression coverage; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0.","final_output":"Fixed owner-membership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all variants only for the updated project’s organization. Authorization remains checked before cache access.\n\nAdded regression coverage; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Both exited 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":8,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-fair-2tip6hsn/tenant-cache-4-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":307,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-2f9dacc020df88fd883a5c8a31f8e83b.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_f